9548:^DD(2,".01","DEL",1900,0)="I $N(^DPT(DA,""S"",DT))+1 W *7,!,""APPOINTMENT(S) PENDING!"""
9549:^DD(2,".01","DEL",3000,0)="I $N(^PS(55,DA,""P"",0))+1 W *7,!,""PATIENT HAS OUTPATIENT PRESCRIPTIONS"""
