9569:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",1,0)="This cross-reference will check the IVM PATIENT file to see if a change"
9570:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",2,0)="to this field will require transmission to the IVM Center.  If it does,"
9571:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",3,0)="the IVM PATIENT file entry's TRANSMISSION STATUS will be set to 0 and"
9572:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",4,0)="the nightly background job will transmit the updated information."
9573:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",5,0)=" "
9574:^DD(2,".02",1,301,"%D",6,0)="Also, if this field is edited, this cross-reference will check to see if the"
