12290:^DD(2,".1417",23,8,0)="ADDRESS CHANGE DT/TM field, it is necessary to kill %DT(0) after the"
12291:^DD(2,".1417",23,9,0)="validation.  This variable, if valued, can prevent EVENT^IVMPLOG from"
12292:^DD(2,".1417",23,10,0)="setting the transmit flag if only the Start and End dates are changed."
