13143:^DD(2,".2403",21,1,0)="Enter the mother's maiden name in 'LAST,FIRST MIDDLE SUFFIX' format."
13144:^DD(2,".2403",21,2,0)="Entry of the LAST name only is permitted and the comma may be omitted."
13145:^DD(2,".2403",21,3,0)="If the response contains no comma, one will be appended to the value."
