13150:^DD(2,".2405",3)="Enter the Preferred Name (1-100 alphabetic characters and/or spaces) for how the patient would like to be addressed at the facility. Vulgarities and offensive language are NOT appropriate responses."
13151:^DD(2,".2405",21,0)="^^8^8^3170207^"
13152:^DD(2,".2405",21,1,0)="The PREFERRED NAME field identifies the name that the patient would "
13153:^DD(2,".2405",21,2,0)="prefer to be referenced by during interactions at the medical facility. "
13154:^DD(2,".2405",21,3,0)="Only alphabetic characters and/or spaces are allowed to be entered. The "
13155:^DD(2,".2405",21,4,0)="PREFERRED NAME value will be converted/stored as uppercase."
13156:^DD(2,".2405",21,5,0)="Note: Vulgarities and other offensive language such as curse and/or"
13157:^DD(2,".2405",21,6,0)="      sexual words are NOT appropriate responses."
13158:^DD(2,".2405",21,7,0)="Note: Examples of Preferred Name for a patient could include their rank "
13159:^DD(2,".2405",21,8,0)="      (Ie. Private LastName), a nickname, etc..."
