14755:^DD(2,".322013",21,5,0)="whether conditions may be related to that service. SW Asia Theater"
14756:^DD(2,".322013",21,6,0)="of operations is defined as: Iraq, Kuwait, Saudi Arabia, the neutral"
14757:^DD(2,".322013",21,7,0)="zone between Iraq and Saudi Arabia, Bahrain, Qatar, the United Arab"
14758:^DD(2,".322013",21,8,0)="Emirates, Oman, the Gulf of Aden, the Gulf of Oman, the Persian Gulf,"
14759:^DD(2,".322013",21,9,0)="the Arabian Sea, the Red Sea, and the airspace above these locations."
