17395:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",1,0)=" This cross-reference is called in response"
17396:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",2,0)=" to enrollment events to notify HEC of"
17397:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",3,0)=" changes that may affect enrollment.  A call"
