17399:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",5,0)=" whether transmission is appropriate for this"
17400:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",6,0)=" patient.  Executing this cross-reference"
17401:^DD(2,".3851",1,1,"%D",7,0)=" will result in the following file and field"
