18259:^DD(2,"27.02",3)="Enter the facility that the patient chooses to designate as his primary location for care."
18260:^DD(2,"27.02",12)="Selected facility must be a treating facility with a valid facility type."
18261:^DD(2,"27.02","12.1")="S DIC(""S"")=""I $$PFTF^DGREGDD(Y)"""
