18813:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,0)="^.001^9^9^3190304^^"
18814:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,1,0)="ORIGINAL APPOINTMENT REQUEST LAST UPDATE DATETIME will be used to compare "
18815:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,2,0)="incoming HL7 change message's datetime stamp to, if populated, what is "
18816:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,3,0)="stored in VistA REE's database. The database will not be updated if the "
18817:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,4,0)="incoming HL7 message is older than what is currently stored. The message "
18818:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,5,0)="will be rejected if it is not more recent than what is stored in VistA "
18819:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,6,0)="REE. "
18820:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,7,0)=" "
18821:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,8,0)="It is an 'display only' field and is not editable by the VistA user and "
18822:^DD(2,"1010.1514",21,9,0)="is used for data verification only."
