21352:^DD("2.0361",".01",1,5,"%D",5,0)="is executed the data still exists in the global.  To determine whether an"
21353:^DD("2.0361",".01",1,5,"%D",6,0)="eligibility still exists the ""B"" x-ref is checked - if not there, the"
21354:^DD("2.0361",".01",1,5,"%D",7,0)="eligibility is ignored."
