22076:^DD("2.101",13,21,0)="^^5^5^2911214^"
22077:^DD("2.101",13,21,1,0)="When a patient is registered, the user registering the patient will be"
22078:^DD("2.101",13,21,2,0)="asked for the patient's eligibility under which they are receiving care."
22079:^DD("2.101",13,21,3,0)="The default will be the primary eligibility code.  However, if the patient"
22080:^DD("2.101",13,21,4,0)="also has other entitled eligibilities (employee, for example), one of"
22081:^DD("2.101",13,21,5,0)="the other eligibilities may also be entered."
