22106:^DD("2.101",17,21,0)="^^5^5^2911214^"
22107:^DD("2.101",17,21,1,0)="The AMIS 400 series reports are generated based on data in the DISPOSITION"
22108:^DD("2.101",17,21,2,0)="LOG-IN DATE/TIME multiple.  When an application is dispositioned, it is"
22109:^DD("2.101",17,21,3,0)="deterined by the module which AMIS segment (401-420) this registration"
22110:^DD("2.101",17,21,4,0)="should fall into.  This information is created automatically by the MAS"
22111:^DD("2.101",17,21,5,0)="module."
