22921:^DD("2.312","2.01",3)="Enter 'YES' if the employer should be mailed insurance claims for pre-processing.  Enter 'NO' if the employer does not receive claims."
22922:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,0)="^^11^11^2930603^^^^"
22923:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,1,0)="If the employer of the person who holds this policy requires that "
