22926:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,4,0)="these bills should be sent to.  The bills will then automatically use"
22927:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,5,0)="this address."
22928:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,6,0)=" "
22929:^DD("2.312","2.01",21,7,0)="If the employer does not require this, or unknown, enter 'NO'.  The bills"
