24086:^DD("2.3216",".01",21,3,0)="GUARD or ACTIVATED RESERVE, the period entered should be the period of"
24087:^DD("2.3216",".01",21,4,0)="activation, so this date is their first day of active duty for the"
24088:^DD("2.3216",".01",21,5,0)="episode. "
