25379:^DD("2.398",1,21,0)="^^4^4^3140818^^^^"
25380:^DD("2.398",1,21,1,0)="NOTE:  This field does not always contain the veteran's raw test"
25381:^DD("2.398",1,21,2,0)="score.  Sometimes you must enter specific information about the"
25382:^DD("2.398",1,21,3,0)="score that may apply to the determination of Catastrophic Disability."
25383:^DD("2.398",1,21,4,0)="See the help text above for more details."
25384:^DD("2.398",1,23,0)="^^3^3^2990520^"
25385:^DD("2.398",1,23,1,0)="The exact criteria for the score are determined by the CATASTROPHIC"
25386:^DD("2.398",1,23,2,0)="DISABILITY REASONS file (#27.17).  That file also contains the help"
25387:^DD("2.398",1,23,3,0)="text for responding to SCORE."
